				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="896" height="449" src="https://vilasjavdekar.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/aboutvj-1.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-117" alt="" srcset="https://vilasjavdekar.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/aboutvj-1.webp 896w, https://vilasjavdekar.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/aboutvj-1-300x150.webp 300w, https://vilasjavdekar.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/aboutvj-1-768x385.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width: 896px) 100vw, 896px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-34201e5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="34201e5" data-element_type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9b0e7b7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9b0e7b7" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c4e7a31 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c4e7a31" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Vilas Javdekar Developers is a prominent real estate development company based in Pune, India. Founded in 1981 by Mr. Vilas Javdekar, the company has established itself as a trusted and respected brand in the real estate industry.<br />With over four decades of experience, Vilas Javdekar Developers has successfully delivered numerous residential, commercial, and mixed-use projects in Pune and other parts of Maharashtra. The company is known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. They prioritize customer satisfaction and aim to create living spaces that cater to the evolving needs and preferences of modern homebuyers. Vilas Javdekar Developers has a strong focus on architectural excellence, incorporating contemporary designs and state-of-the-art amenities into their projects.<br />One of the key pillars of Vilas Javdekar Developers&#8217; philosophy is sustainable development. They strive to create eco-friendly and energy-efficient projects, integrating green building practices and technologies. Their projects often incorporate features such as rainwater harvesting, solar power systems, and waste management systems, promoting a greener and more sustainable lifestyle.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-661e28b elementor-align-center offer elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="661e28b" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;pulse&quot;}" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-pulse" href="#">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Know More</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
